# Typed Static Collections in Rocdown

We are delighted to introduce typed static collections in Rocdown!

## What Collections Provide

- **Deterministic Date Ordering**: Posts are sorted newest first, with robust tie-breaking on title and canonical route.
- **Automated Feed Generation**: Full Atom 1.0 feeds are generated at `/news/feed.xml` with zero extra configuration.
- **Zero-touch Indexing**: Adding a new `.rocdown` article automatically updates the news index, homepage recent highlights, and sitemap without touching any `.rocci` theme files.

Read the [documentation](/docs/) to start using typed collections in your own projects!
